@page
@model Aibysitter.Web.Pages.Notes.IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Rules";
}

<h1>Rules</h1>

<h2>Rules files</h2>
<p>Checked by the <a asp-page="/Lint">lint page</a> against a CLAUDE.md or AGENTS.md.</p>
<partial name="_RulesTable" model="Model.Rows" />

<h2>Scoring</h2>
<p>Each file starts at @Aibysitter.Rules.Scorer.MaxScore. Each finding deducts by severity: Error @Aibysitter.Rules.Scorer.Weight(Aibysitter.Rules.Severity.Error), Warning @Aibysitter.Rules.Scorer.Weight(Aibysitter.Rules.Severity.Warning), Info @Aibysitter.Rules.Scorer.Weight(Aibysitter.Rules.Severity.Info). Deductions per rule are capped at @Aibysitter.Rules.Scorer.PerRuleCap. Grades: A ≥ 90, B ≥ 80, C ≥ 70, D ≥ 60, F below 60.</p>
<p>Fenced code blocks are excluded from all rules. Headings are excluded from R001–R003.</p>

<h2>Pull request checks</h2>
<p>Run by the <a asp-page="/GitHub">GitHub App</a> on every pull request in an installed repository.</p>
<partial name="_RulesTable" model="Model.CheckRows" />
